(github.com/vibec-studios/vibey-multiplayer) and the lyrics module (src/main/java/dev/henny/vibeyclient/module/lyrics/)
on Vibey Lyrics (github.com/vibec-studios/vibey-lyrics), both Copyright (c) 2026 Vibe Craft Studios. What was
published there before 2026-11-18 stays available under the MIT License; the license texts are in
licenses/vibey-multiplayer-MIT.txt and licenses/vibey-lyrics-MIT.txt (inside the jars under licenses/vibeyclient/).

These lyrics files were published in Vibey Lyrics under MIT and remain available under it:
  src/main/resources/assets/vibeyclient/textures/lyrics/sky/{aurora,candy,crimson,dreamy,galaxy,golden,moonlight,
    nebula,saturn,streak,sunset,synthwave}.png (+ .png.mcmeta),
  src/main/resources/assets/vibeyclient/lyrics/demo/pixel_skies.ogg and pixel_skies.lrc.

